      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Authentication Test Workflow\n\n**Purpose:** Test different URLs and auth methods to diagnose the issue.\n\n**Check your credentials:**\n1. Username should be: `admin` (lowercase)\n2. Password default is: `password`\n3. Check the label on your modem for the password\n\n**What to look for:**\n- If Test 1 succeeds → Auth is working\n- If Test 2 succeeds → Homepage doesn't need auth\n- If Test 3 succeeds → RouterStatus needs auth and it's working\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Wrong password (check modem label)\n- Username has capital letters (should be lowercase `admin`)\n- IP address is different (try 192.168.0.1 or 192.168.1.1)\n\n**After running this:**\nTell me which tests succeed (green) and which fail (red), and I'll know how to fix the workflow.",
